    "description": "<p>When the @Lookup[@name] makes a successful attack against a PC, you can <strong>mark a Stress</strong> to force the target to make a Strength Reaction Roll. On a failure, they take <strong>2d4+2</strong> physical damage. If the target marks HP from this attack, they can only move within Very Close range as their normal movement until they clear at least 1 HP.</p>",
